sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Controller as StatisticsController
    participant Service as StatisticsService
    participant Dao as StatisticsDao
    participant Enum as reportType

    Note over User, Enum: 导出统计报表
    User->>Controller: 点击"导出报表"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 导出数据报表
    activate Service

    alt 导出个人统计
        Service->>Dao: 查询用户投递明细
        Service->>Dao: 查询面试邀约明细
        Service->>Service: 生成个人统计Excel
    else 导出企业统计
        Service->>Dao: 查询企业职位明细
        Service->>Dao: 查询简历接收明细
        Service->>Service: 生成企业统计Excel
    else 导出平台统计
        Service->>Service: 聚合平台各维度数据
        Service->>Dao: 生成平台报表Excel<br/>(多Sheet)
    end

    Note right of Enum: 报表类型:<br/>- PERSONAL: 个人统计<br/>- ENTERPRISE: 企业统计<br/>- PLATFORM: 平台统计<br/>- REGIONAL: 区域报表

    Service-->>Controller: 返回Excel文件流
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>User: 下载Excel文件
    deactivate Controller